pan>&gt; design direction · identity, print, web</span><p>Team: Bradley Hawkins, Madeline Pellman, Kate Ferrara, Brian Zeiders, Anna Spisak</p></aside><section class=\"ns-and-surfaces xc-pad\"><div class=\"xc-section-heading\"><span class=\"xc-eyebrow\">THE SAME HAND / DIFFERENT SURFACES</span><h2>Stamped.<br><em>Then shipped.</em></h2></div><div class=\"ac-gallery\" data-ac-gallery=\"andculture\" data-ac-selected=\"identity\"><div class=\"ac-gallery-choices\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Explore Andculture identity and website\"><button type=\"button\" data-ac-choice=\"identity\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"cursor-interaction\"><span>01</span>By hand</button><button type=\"button\" data-ac-choice=\"home\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"cursor-interaction\"><span>02</span>On the web</button><button type=\"button\" data-ac-choice=\"mobile\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"cursor-interaction\"><span>03</span>In your hand</button></div><figure class=\"xc-media ac-gallery-art\"><div class=\"and-gallery-window\"><img src=\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-identity.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"Kraft business cards with halftone illustrations and the pink ampersand mark, with the rubber stamp used to print them\" data-ac-image></div><figcaption><span data-ac-caption role=\"status\">Kraft business cards with halftone illustrations and the pink ampersand mark, with the rubber stamp used to print them</span><button type=\"button\" data-ac-inspect class=\"cursor-interaction\">Inspect the work ↗</button></figcaption></figure><a class=\"and-gallery-explore cursor-interaction\" href=\"#and-web-scroll\" data-xc-chapter-link>Scroll through the homepage ↓</a><script type=\"application/json\" data-ac-gallery-data>{\"identity\":{\"title\":\"By hand\",\"caption\":\"Kraft business cards with halftone illustrations and the pink ampersand mark, with the rubber stamp used to print them\",\"src\":\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-identity.webp\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1050},\"home\":{\"title\":\"On the web\",\"caption\":\"Homepage with Delacroix's Liberty Leading the People behind the line Craftsmen of Change and Culture\",\"src\":\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-home.webp\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":3707},\"mobile\":{\"title\":\"In your hand\",\"caption\":\"The site on a phone\",\"src\":\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-mobile.webp\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":622}}</script></div></section><article class=\"xc-story\"><section id=\"andculture-introduction\" class=\"xc-chapter xc-chapter-0\"><span class=\"xc-chapter-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01 / ANDCULTURE</span><h2>The brief</h2><p style=\"grid-row:2\" data-extended-source=\"andculture-source-1\">Andculture is an experience design agency in Harrisburg, Pennsylvania. In 2014 it wanted a more focused brand, and the one it had looked stale and too technical. I was Design Director there and led the rebrand and the website refresh. I directed the team that designed and built them, and stayed hands-on along the way.</p><p style=\"grid-row:3\" data-extended-source=\"andculture-source-2\">The agency built user experiences and software, but it didn't want to lose the craft behind that work. The creativity, the art, the habit of keeping a hand in it. That became the line the brand was built on. Craftsmen of change and culture.</p><p style=\"grid-row:4\" data-extended-source=\"andculture-source-3\">The brand also chose who it was for. We aimed it at startups, mainly well-funded ones, and the homepage said so plainly. It asked for revolutionaries.</p><p style=\"grid-row:5\" data-extended-source=\"andculture-source-4\">Nobody ordered business cards. Each person had their own stamp, and when they ran low, they stamped more. The craft line wasn't only on the website. Everyone at the agency did it by hand.</p><p style=\"grid-row:6\" data-extended-source=\"andculture-source-5\">Business went up after the rebrand, and Andculture got talked about in the startup community. Startups liked that the same team could make something by hand and build the software behind it.</p><p style=\"grid-row:7\" data-extended-source=\"andculture-source-6\">Team: Bradley Hawkins, Madeline Pellman, Kate Ferrara, Brian Zeiders, Anna Spisak</p></section></article><section class=\"ns-evidence xc-pad\"><div class=\"xc-section-heading\"><span class=\"xc-eyebrow\">THE WORK / IDENTITY TO WEBSITE</span><h2>Craft that<br><em>carries through.</em></h2></div><div class=\"and-evidence-composition\"><figure class=\"xc-media and-print-figure\"><img src=\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-identity.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1050\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Kraft business cards with halftone illustrations and the pink ampersand mark, with the rubber stamp used to print them\"><figcaption><span data-extended-source=\"andculture-source-7\">Kraft business cards with halftone illustrations and the pink ampersand mark, with the rubber stamp used to print them</span><button type=\"button\" data-xc-inspect=\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-identity.webp\" data-xc-caption=\"Kraft business cards with halftone illustrations and the pink ampersand mark, with the rubber stamp used to print them\" class=\"cursor-interaction\">Inspect the work ↗</button></figcaption></figure><section id=\"and-web-scroll\" class=\"and-web-scroll\" data-and-web-scroll><div class=\"and-web-stage\"><div class=\"and-web-context\"><span class=\"xc-eyebrow\">01 / THE HOMEPAGE</span><h3>Andculture,<br><em>on the web.</em></h3><p class=\"and-scroll-prompt\">Scroll to explore ↓</p><div class=\"and-page-positions\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Homepage preview position\"><button type=\"button\" data-and-position=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Top</button><button type=\"button\" data-and-position=\"0.5\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Middle</button><button type=\"button\" data-and-position=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">End</button></div></div><figure class=\"xc-media and-homepage-figure\" data-case-motion-static><div class=\"and-page-window\"><img src=\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-home.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"3707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Homepage with Delacroix's Liberty Leading the People behind the line Craftsmen of Change and Culture\"></div><figcaption><span data-extended-source=\"andculture-source-8\">Homepage with Delacroix's Liberty Leading the People behind the line Craftsmen of Change and Culture</span><button type=\"button\" data-xc-inspect=\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-home.webp\" data-xc-caption=\"Homepage with Delacroix's Liberty Leading the People behind the line Craftsmen of Change and Culture\" class=\"cursor-interaction\">Inspect the work ↗</button></figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"and-supporting-pages\" aria-label=\"Andculture supporting website pages\"><div class=\"and-page-pair\"><figure class=\"xc-media and-page-poster and-work-poster\" data-case-motion-static><div class=\"and-poster-window\"><img src=\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-work.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"8560\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"The work page\"></div><figcaption><span data-extended-source=\"andculture-source-9\">The work page</span><button type=\"button\" data-xc-inspect=\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-work.webp\" data-xc-caption=\"The work page\" class=\"cursor-interaction\">Inspect the work ↗</button></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"xc-media and-page-poster and-blog-poster\" data-case-motion-static><div class=\"and-poster-window\"><img src=\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-blog.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"6578\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"The blog\"></div><figcaption><span data-extended-source=\"andculture-source-10\">The blog</span><button type=\"button\" data-xc-inspect=\"/portfolio/case-assets/andculture-andculture-blog.webp\" data-xc-caption=\"The blog\" class=\"cursor-interaction\">Inspect the work ↗</button></figcaption></figure><